						 <p>This is a rewrite for a previously deleted article by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gamerboyali" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6944105&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369300" alt="GamerboyAli" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6944105)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gamerboyali" >GamerboyAli</a></span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Click&nbsp;Here&nbsp;to&nbsp;see&nbsp;Permission&nbsp;of&nbsp;Rewrite</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><img src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/661014015476105228/769971201086062642/Screenshot_20201025-114130_Firefox.jpg" alt="Screenshot_20201025-114130_Firefox.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> <p>Id like to give a special thank you to these Critters, who were vital in making this work:</p> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369300" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" >Dysadron</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themanhattenproject" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3809943&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="TheManhattenProject" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3809943)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themanhattenproject" >TheManhattenProject</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oystershell" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2796394&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="Oystershell" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2796394)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oystershell" >Oystershell</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoplexic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2767424&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606369301" alt="Apoplexic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2767424)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoplexic" >Apoplexic</a></span></p> <p><strong>EDIT:</strong> I'm aware that the graph image in Addendum 3 is hard to see. I have attempted several fixes; however, the problem seems to stem from the Y2K theme and its pixelated aesthetic.</p> 
